### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Publish a message
POST http://localhost:8000/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "sensors/room-admin/temperature",
  "payload": "29.5"
}

### Read every buffered message
GET http://localhost:8000/messages

### Read one topic (topics may contain slashes)
GET http://localhost:8000/messages/sensors/room-admin/temperature

### Predict a temperature
POST http://localhost:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hour": 12,
  "day": 15,
  "month": 9,
  "year": 2018,
  "out_in": 1
}
